@name     envelope
@alias    t
@group    env
@c_name   skode_clause_env_set
@type     realtime
@arity    4
@match    (finite, finite, finite, finite)
@summary  configure ADSR envelope parameters (attack, decay, sustain, release)
@doc
Sets the attack time, decay time, sustain level, and release time for the active voice envelope.
Usage: t a d s r (or envelope a d s r)
@code
    if (voice < 0 || voice >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    return envelope_set(voice, args[0], args[1], args[2], args[3]);
@end
